# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Fluency — files that must NOT be published
#
#  This repository is served by GitHub Pages, which makes every
#  committed file publicly downloadable. Anything listed here is
#  either too large for GitHub, or should not be public.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Screen recordings — GitHub rejects files over 100 MB
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi

# Internal business documents (would be downloadable by anyone)
*.docx
*.pdf

# Apps Script backend — lives in the Apps Script editor, not on the
# website. It contains the master spreadsheet id and the notification
# email, so it must not be served publicly.
Code.gs

# Node scripts used once to generate the .docx documents
build_master_doc.js
build_captain_recruitment.js
generate_report.js
package.json
node_modules/

# Local editor / OS files
.vscode/
.claude/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
